WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:41.469
Peter and Benjamin looked for the missing nuts.

2
00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:52.780
Timmy gathered new ones.

3
00:00:52.781 --> 00:00:56.490
"The squirrels are very busy," Peter said.

4
00:00:56.491 --> 00:00:59.326
"They are gathering lots of nuts."

5
00:00:59.327 --> 00:01:02.806
"Winter is coming," Benjamin said.

6
00:01:02.807 --> 00:01:03.489
"They need—"

7
00:01:03.490 --> 00:01:07.762
"Hey!" A squirrel suddenly shouted.

8
00:01:07.763 --> 00:01:11.672
"Look at my pile!" a second squirrel cried.

9
00:01:11.673 --> 00:01:17.825
"Who stole my nuts?" a third squirrel yelled.

10
00:01:17.826 --> 00:01:21.180
More squirrels came running.

11
00:01:21.181 --> 00:01:24.035
One squirrel shouted at Timmy Tiptoes.

12
00:01:24.036 --> 00:01:28.042
"Did you steal our nuts?" she cried.

13
00:01:28.043 --> 00:01:30.447
"No!" Timmy said.

14
00:01:30.448 --> 00:01:33.892
"Someone took some of my nuts too.

15
00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:37.353
There is a nut thief!"

16
00:01:37.354 --> 00:01:44.487
The squirrels shouted back and forth.

17
00:01:44.488 --> 00:01:50.440
Just then Peter spotted a fat squirrel.

18
00:01:50.441 --> 00:01:53.495
"Look, Benjamin!" Peter whispered.

19
00:01:53.496 --> 00:01:55.966
"It's Silvertail."

20
00:01:55.967 --> 00:02:00.387
Silvertail slipped over to the nut piles.

21
00:02:00.392 --> 00:02:03.218
The squirrels were still fighting.

22
00:02:03.219 --> 00:02:06.888
They did not see Silvertail.

23
00:02:06.889 --> 00:02:28.510
He took nuts from a pile!

24
00:02:28.511 --> 00:02:34.056
Silvertail hid the nuts under a log.

25
00:02:34.057 --> 00:02:38.058
Then he laughed.

26
00:02:38.059 --> 00:02:40.988
"I have lots of nuts for winter.

27
00:02:40.989 --> 00:02:53.676
I don't have to work at all!"
